1
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,805
Jihoon…

2
00:00:06,773 --> 00:00:08,942
Us getting back together…

3
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:11,845
Is it a mistake…?

4
00:00:12,846 --> 00:00:14,814
Huh…?

5
00:00:15,982 --> 00:00:18,218
I feel like I keep…

6
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:22,322
Expecting you to be the way you used to be

7
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,626
But you're not the same person anymore

8
00:00:27,394 --> 00:00:29,295
Hyung… It's only been one day

9
00:00:29,295 --> 00:00:31,498
since we restarted

10
00:00:31,498 --> 00:00:34,667
It's probably just awkward right now…

11
00:00:36,403 --> 00:00:38,071
Ah… right?

12
00:00:38,471 --> 00:00:40,607
I was thinking too much

13
00:00:40,607 --> 00:00:42,275
I'm sorry

14
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,221
Jihoon…

15
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:57,390
What should we do on our next date?

16
00:00:57,390 --> 00:01:00,226
Hmm… I'm not sure

17
00:01:01,561 --> 00:01:03,096
How about the ocean?

18
00:01:03,096 --> 00:01:05,131
You like the ocean

19
00:01:06,566 --> 00:01:08,501
In this weather? The ocean?

20
00:01:08,501 --> 00:01:10,403
And you don't even like the ocean

21
00:01:10,403 --> 00:01:12,272
No, that's not it

22
00:01:12,272 --> 00:01:14,507
I'm trying to like it now

23
00:01:14,707 --> 00:01:17,010
I'll like anything you like

24
00:01:18,578 --> 00:01:21,081
Hyung… just be how you were

25
00:01:21,081 --> 00:01:23,550
You don't have to force yourself

26
00:01:29,556 --> 00:01:31,825
I should get going

27
00:01:32,792 --> 00:01:35,261
Jihoon, wait

28
00:01:38,398 --> 00:01:40,633
This is for you

29
00:01:46,806 --> 00:01:49,109
What's wrong with you?

30
00:01:49,676 --> 00:01:51,244
What?

31
00:01:51,711 --> 00:01:52,645
No matter what I do

32
00:01:52,645 --> 00:01:55,548
You keep putting up a wall with me

33
00:01:56,116 --> 00:01:59,052
Weren't you the one
who said we should get back together?

34
00:01:59,586 --> 00:02:01,521
I've been trying this whole time

35
00:02:01,521 --> 00:02:04,591
So what am I supposed to do
if you keep acting like this?

36
00:02:04,958 --> 00:02:07,393
What do you even mean by trying?

37
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:10,029
Pretending to be sweet?

38
00:02:10,196 --> 00:02:13,700
Forcing yourself to match everything I want?

39
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:15,869
You said you wanted me to be more affectionate

40
00:02:15,869 --> 00:02:18,471
You said you wanted to feel loved

41
00:02:18,471 --> 00:02:20,240
But when you act like it's some chore

42
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,809
That's what makes me uncomfortable

43
00:02:23,042 --> 00:02:25,245
Then what am I supposed to do?

44
00:02:25,612 --> 00:02:29,115
If I'm affectionate, you say I'm pretending

45
00:02:29,115 --> 00:02:30,016
If I act like before

46
00:02:30,016 --> 00:02:32,318
We'll just end up fighting and breaking up again

47
00:02:32,318 --> 00:02:34,687
So what am I supposed to do?

48
00:02:38,057 --> 00:02:41,494
You… are you crying?

49
00:02:48,968 --> 00:02:51,971
I don't know what to do either

50
00:02:52,272 --> 00:02:55,074
I want to try again with you

51
00:02:55,308 --> 00:02:58,711
But I keep seeing who you used to be…

52
00:02:58,945 --> 00:03:00,547
And because of that…

53
00:03:00,547 --> 00:03:03,449
I end up being defensive all the time

54
00:03:22,669 --> 00:03:23,803
I'm sorry

55
00:03:23,803 --> 00:03:25,338
I'm really late, right?

56
00:03:25,338 --> 00:03:27,340
Traffic was so bad today

57
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:29,075
Hyung… what are you doing?

58
00:03:29,075 --> 00:03:31,911
Wow, you look even better in person

59
00:03:32,111 --> 00:03:33,813
Oh, you haven't ordered yet, right?

60
00:03:33,813 --> 00:03:34,747
Since I'm late

61
00:03:34,747 --> 00:03:35,949
Coffee's on me

62
00:03:35,949 --> 00:03:37,483
What would you like?

63
00:03:37,483 --> 00:03:39,085
What are you doing?

64
00:03:39,085 --> 00:03:41,154
I've been thinking about it

65
00:03:41,154 --> 00:03:44,390
I think we should go back to the way we first met

66
00:03:45,158 --> 00:03:47,527
If we keep leaning on old memories

67
00:03:47,527 --> 00:03:49,762
And comparing everything to the past

68
00:03:49,762 --> 00:03:53,900
We'll just stay stuck back there

69
00:03:55,401 --> 00:03:57,403
So that's why you're acting like this?

70
00:03:57,403 --> 00:03:58,972
Yeah

71
00:03:59,806 --> 00:04:01,874
Do you remember this café?

72
00:04:01,874 --> 00:04:04,277
It's where we first met

73
00:04:05,011 --> 00:04:06,679
I was about twenty minutes late

74
00:04:06,679 --> 00:04:08,581
And you were so annoyed

75
00:04:08,581 --> 00:04:11,884
Oh please, when was I ever annoyed?

76
00:04:14,487 --> 00:04:16,122
You were twenty minutes late

77
00:04:16,122 --> 00:04:18,391
You could've at least texted me

78
00:04:18,391 --> 00:04:19,993
I'm sorry

79
00:04:19,993 --> 00:04:21,261
What would you like?

80
00:04:21,261 --> 00:04:23,863
The cake here is really good too

81
00:04:38,645 --> 00:04:40,046
Good, right?

82
00:04:40,046 --> 00:04:42,048
Wow, this cake is really good

83
00:04:42,048 --> 00:04:43,850
Have some more

84
00:04:43,850 --> 00:04:45,518
I'll get dinner later too

85
00:04:45,518 --> 00:04:47,487
What do you want?

86
00:04:47,487 --> 00:04:49,122
Hmm…

87
00:04:49,122 --> 00:04:51,524
Should I try to guess?

88
00:04:53,026 --> 00:04:55,828
I'm guessing Fried chicken is number one

89
00:04:56,362 --> 00:04:58,731
Number two is gopchang

90
00:04:58,731 --> 00:05:00,867
And number three… pasta?

91
00:05:01,301 --> 00:05:02,902
Wow, that's spot on

92
00:05:02,902 --> 00:05:03,936
Really?

93
00:05:03,936 --> 00:05:05,371
I got all of them right?

94
00:05:05,371 --> 00:05:08,708
Yeah, people would think we dated for five years

95
00:05:08,708 --> 00:05:10,910
I don't know, I just had a feeling

96
00:05:10,910 --> 00:05:13,680
Like… this guy definitely likes fried chicken

97
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:17,617
Then should we get fried chicken for dinner?

98
00:05:18,017 --> 00:05:19,052
Sounds good

99
00:05:19,052 --> 00:05:20,753
Do you like beer too?

100
00:05:20,753 --> 00:05:22,355
Yeah, I do

101
00:05:22,355 --> 00:05:24,557
Then let's have some beer too

102
00:05:29,262 --> 00:05:31,064
Come in

103
00:05:35,301 --> 00:05:36,502
When you said dinner

104
00:05:36,502 --> 00:05:38,237
You meant at your place?

105
00:05:38,237 --> 00:05:39,939
Yeah, why?

106
00:05:39,939 --> 00:05:41,341
Is that not okay?

107
00:05:41,341 --> 00:05:44,043
No, it's not that…

108
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:45,645
Have a seat

109
00:05:45,645 --> 00:05:47,814
I'll grab some beer

110
00:05:56,689 --> 00:05:58,191
You're drinking beer, right?

111
00:05:58,191 --> 00:05:59,659
Yeah

112
00:06:11,037 --> 00:06:13,172
This is good

113
00:06:13,306 --> 00:06:14,273
It's getting cold

114
00:06:14,273 --> 00:06:16,142
Eat up

115
00:06:26,686 --> 00:06:28,121
How is it?

116
00:06:28,121 --> 00:06:29,989
It's good

117
00:06:29,989 --> 00:06:31,691
Not the food

118
00:06:31,691 --> 00:06:34,427
I mean… how does this feel today?

119
00:06:34,927 --> 00:06:37,663
Are you still… uncomfortable?

120
00:06:38,364 --> 00:06:40,967
Hmm…

121
00:06:43,169 --> 00:06:46,005
No, I think it's okay

122
00:06:46,606 --> 00:06:48,808
That's a relief

123
00:06:50,977 --> 00:06:52,979
Thank you

124
00:07:02,288 --> 00:07:04,924
Top or bottom?

125
00:07:06,092 --> 00:07:08,261
Bottom

126
00:07:08,995 --> 00:07:10,997
Nice

127
00:07:37,023 --> 00:07:39,625
Is it okay to be like this on a first date?

128
00:07:39,625 --> 00:07:42,462
Feels like we did this before

129
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,700
"The Long Relationship"
